# Derm AI - Environment Configuration Template
# All secret API keys are kept securely on the server via Next.js backend proxy routes (/api/analyze, /api/uv).
# NEVER expose paid or private API keys to the browser bundle!

# 1. Skin Analysis API (autoderm.ai)
# Required for analyzing skin conditions via images
AUTODERM_API_KEY=""

# 2. UV Index Tracking
# Primary: OpenUV API (openuv.io)
OPENUV_API_KEY=""
# Fallback: OpenWeather API (openweathermap.org)
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=""

# 3. Air Quality Tracking
# World Air Quality Index (aqicn.org)
WAQI_API_TOKEN=""

# (Optional: Legacy fallback support for NEXT_PUBLIC_* is still active in backend proxies)
